e** cleanly injects encrypted quiz data into the obfuscated `index.html`.\n4. **Sync & Changelog**:\n   - Re-sync `quizzes/template` in Firestore with the obfuscated `index.html`, verify execution in Edge (`file:///` and HTTP), and append **Non-Major Patch 1.0.20** to [HISTORY.md](file:///c:/Users/CxAdmin/Desktop/Exploit/HISTORY.md).\n\nPlease review the [implementation plan](file:///C:/Users/CxAdmin/.gemini/antigravity/brain/8f2bd4b5-d81b-4839-aa40-a5c3a5acaa6a/implementation_plan.md) and reply with **\"proceed\"** (or click the Proceed button) to implement these changes.\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"read_file","args":{"EndLine":"460","Path":"\"c:\\\\Users\\\\CxAdmin\\\\Desktop\\\\Exploit\\\\index.html\"","StartLine":"295"}},{"name":"read_file","args":{"EndLine":"635","Path":"\"c:\\\\Users\\\\CxAdmin\\\\Desktop\\\\Exploit\\\\teacher.html\"","StartLine":"520"}}]}
